{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00824","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 观成舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 观成舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆穆王国，奕奕神功。\n毖祀载展，明德有融。\n彝樽斯满，簠簋斯丰。\n纷絺旄羽，锵洋磬钟。\n或升或降，克和克同。\n孔惠之礼，必肃之容。\n锡以纯嘏，祚其允恭。\n神保是飨，万世无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}